SMSHub Android Adaptive Icon — Placeholder Description
=======================================================

Design: Foreground layer for Android adaptive icons:
- Transparent background
- Chat/message bubble icon centered in the safe zone (66.67% of total area)
- Icon color: #2563eb (blue-600) with slight gradient to #60a5fa
- Size: 1024x1024 PNG with transparency

The Android system will mask this with a circle, squircle, or other shape
depending on the device manufacturer. Keep the icon well within the safe zone.

To generate:
1. Create 1024x1024 canvas with transparent background
2. Center the message bubble icon within the inner 682x682 area
3. Export as PNG with alpha
4. Save as mobile/assets/adaptive-icon.png
